Third-party components
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Mochi links against third-party Rust crates at build time. Every dependency is
required by CI (see deny.toml) to be distributed under a permissive licence:
Apache-2.0, MIT, BSD-2-Clause, BSD-3-Clause, ISC, Zlib, BSL-1.0, Unicode-3.0,
CC0-1.0 or Unlicense. Copyleft licences (GPL / LGPL / AGPL / MPL) are rejected.

The bundled SQLite amalgamation reached through `libsqlite3-sys` is in the
public domain (https://www.sqlite.org/copyright.html).

